graph\" >\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f <strong>Cozy 3D game room</strong> with multiple camera angles (frontal, side, etc.) for each chair or couch spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Built-in chat system</strong>, with player-colored messages based on their seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Free Mode</strong>: Walk around the room freely and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Keyboard shortcuts</strong> for passing turns, playing music, or exiting the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb <strong>Player list</strong>, room name, FPS, and ping displayed in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Sound effects</strong> for dice rolls, chess pieces, Air Hockey, and Pong Crostle 2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca4 <strong>AFK system</strong> that kicks inactive players to keep the experience smooth for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for having fun with friends or family in a shared virtual room full of classic games and cozy vibes!</strong></p>",
